    profile_hir_workers_darwin_only_linux_lacks_process_group_retire_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 fix-implemented. Since 35541505cd5 HIR profile workers need POV4 ProcessGroup retirement; the Linux C owner never advertised POV4_CAP_PROCESS_GROUP_RETIRE, admitted only Leader policy and had no Linux owned_group_retire_ready body, so every Linux HIR pool started no worker (reason: process observation unavailable: process-group-retire). Fix: /proc pgid live scan + fail-closed probe. Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/profile_hir_workers_darwin_only_linux_lacks_process_group_retire_2026-11-12.md."

